# What EAS must NOT upload to the build servers.
#
# Without this file EAS packages the working directory, which on a developer's
# machine also holds the café's internal web system and a 2 MB scratch file.
# None of it is needed to build the app, and the first of them holds employee
# records. Keep this list explicit rather than relying on .gitignore.

# The internal web system (HR, payroll, attendance, biometrics, finance).
SUNRAY_OS_V20/

# The retired Express backend — archived on its own branch, never built here.
backend/

# Local scratch data
mooninfo.json

# Native folders are regenerated by prebuild on the build server; uploading a
# stale local copy is how a build ends up one version behind the config.
android/
ios/

# Notes and planning — not build inputs.
docs/
.claude/
